# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# College Board material — NEVER COMMIT
#
# Git history is permanent. Essay text, verbatim scoring guidelines and the
# exam PDFs are College Board copyright; their published grant covers limited
# reproduction by AP teachers for face-to-face teaching, not electronic
# redistribution. The harness FETCHES this material on demand — run
# harness/corpus/build.py and you get your own local copy.
#
# The one deliberate exception is the handful of rubric criteria quoted
# on-screen in mockups/, which are illustrative and attributed in the UI.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
corpus/
*.pdf
corpus.jsonl
samples.json
rubric*.md
rubrics.json
blind*.jsonl
ocr/
ocr_verified/
*-layout.txt
*-flow.txt
stimulus.txt

# Raw grading output — carries essay ids and, in some arms, essay text
results_raw*.json
results_run*.json
*.results.jsonl

